    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP — DO THIS BEFORE ACTIVATING\n\n**1. Enable Data Tables** (self-hosted only)\nSet env var `N8N_ENABLED_MODULES=data-table` and restart n8n. Requires version 1.113+.\nOn n8n Cloud: should be available if your plan supports it.\n\n**2. Create the whitelist table in the UI**\nGo to **Data tables** (left sidebar) → **Create Data table** → name it `whitelist` with one column:\n- `domain` (string)\n\n**3. Wire up the Data Table nodes**\nOpen each of the 4 yellow Data Table nodes in this workflow and select the `whitelist` table from the dropdown. (Table IDs aren't portable across n8n instances — same as Google Sheets.)\n\n**4. Configure admin authorization**\nOpen the **Authorize Command** node and set `ADMIN_CHAT_IDS` to your admin Telegram chat ID. Currently pre-filled with `-5214879667`.\n\n**5. Seed the whitelist**\nAfter activating, send `/add @yourdomain.com` from the admin chat. List with `/list`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 420
      },
